# SECRETS — these must never enter a build context, let alone a layer.
# .studio/ holds the encrypted keystore and .env.local; a COPY of the repo
# root would otherwise bake the signing key into a shareable image.
**/.studio/
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Local state that must come from a volume, not a layer: baking it in would
# ship one machine's rebalance history and locks to every container.
**/.agent-data/
**/lp_state*.json

**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.git/
**/wheels/
bnbLpRangeRebalancer/agentcore/cdk/
